"action_reference":{"free_actions":{"title":"Free Actions","note":"One during a Simple Action","items":["Activate/deactivate cyberware","Drop object","Gesture","Speak","Change gun modes","Draw or sheathe a weapon","Eject a magazine","Use a simple tool (flip a switch, open a door, etc.)","Stabilize a gun (if not fired this round)"]},"simple_actions":{"title":"Simple Actions","note":"Most characters start with 2","items":["Activate a magic item","Stand up from prone","Move the character's movement rate","Fire a firearm in a SS, DT, or BF Mode.","Make a projectile weapon attack","Make a melee attack","Reload a weapon","Aim","Throw weapon","Pick up an object"]},"complex_actions":{"title":"Complex Actions","note":"Usually costs 2 Simple Actions","items":["Cast a spell","Fire a firearm on full auto","Fire a heavy weapon","Use gunnery to fire a vehicle weapon","Prepare a simple action to trigger under a condition (until your next turn)","Use a complex object (digital lock, computer)","Use a skill","Reload a crossbow","Use bio-gel/stims/drugs","Withdraw","Sprint/Charge: 2x Move and roll Brawn, where each success is +2m. At the end, make a free melee attack."]},"reflex_actions":{"title":"Reflex Actions","note":"One per round","items":["Hit the Dirt! Drop Prone + 2 Penalty dice on attacks","Counterspell! Sorcery test > spell successes","Fire in the Hole! Reposition 4 m and roll dodge versus explosion.","Wait a Moment! Delay (Act later in the round)","Overwatch! Make a single shot/burst (-2 penalty dice)","Get Down! If w/n 2 meters of a tgt, you can move to take the damage"]},"conflict_sequence":{"title":"Conflict Round Sequence","note":"","items":["At Start of Conflict, Roll Initiative (Roll Focus pool and add successes to Reaction Attribute). Initiative is static through the Conflict. When Initiative is rolled, refresh Kismet Pool.","All dice pools (except the Kismet pool) refresh.","Characters and opponents take actions when their initiative number comes up.","Once everyone has acted, return to step 1."]},"resolving_ranged":{"title":"Resolving Ranged Combat","note":"","items":["Choose a target.","Select a ranged weapon to fire.","If necessary, determine the attack mode (single shot, double tap, burst, or fully automatic).","Determine range + penalty","If the target has total cover, weapon penetration > barrier rating","Total the number of dice, skill + accuracy to get your limit.","Total any bonus dice from firing mode, bright light, point-blank range, etc.","Total any penalty dice from range, cover, situations, and lighting.","Apply the modifiers. If there are more penalty dice than bonus dice, once the bonus dice are eliminated, penalty dice lower the limit.","Make an attack test.","The target may spend Finesse pool to dodge.","If any successes remain, the target is hit. If the number of successes is reduced to zero, the shot misses.","Weapon's armor penetration > ballistic armor lethal otherwise stun.","Add successes to the weapon's damage value is damage applied.","Energy weapons strip one armor","Ballistic armor lowers damage.","The target may spend Brawn pool to soak.","Apply damage."]},"resolving_melee":{"title":"Resolving Melee Combat","note":"","items":["Choose a target, optional move 2 m (1\")","Make an attack test from the Brawn pool.","Lower the limit by 2 dice if target has reach advantage. Add +2 bonus dice if not holding a melee weapon.","The target may use their Finesse pool to dodge.","If any success remains, the target is hit. If the number of successes is reduced to zero, the attack misses.","Total the damage, and add the weapon's damage to the number of successes.","Impact armor lowers damage","The target can use their Brawn pool to soak.","Apply damage. Melee let characters choose if this damage is physical or stun."]}}
